    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A consignment bilty issued by an Indian Bank Association (IBA) approved agent acts as the bill of lading for the transport. It records the consignor, consignee, vehicle details, and transport terms.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>Providing these documents in advance helps avoid last‑minute delays and ensures that the transporter can comply with regulatory checks at checkpoints across the state.</p>
<h3>Why 100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance Matters</h3>
<p>When cars are shipped via sea routes—common for long‑distance or international moves—a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance policy is indispensable. This coverage guarantees that the entire market value of the vehicle is insured against:</p>
<ul>
<li>Loss or damage due to rough seas, cargo mishandling, or accidental strikes.</li>
<li>Theft, vandalism, or natural calamities occurring during loading, transit, or unloading.</li>
<li>Liability claims from third parties resulting from the vehicle’s movement.</li>
</ul>
<p>Unlike standard policies that offer limited coverage, a 100% declared‑value plan ensures you are compensated for the full purchase price of the car, reducing financial exposure and providing peace of mind. Transporters in Azamgarh typically require proof of such insurance before accepting the vehicle, so be sure to secure this policy well in advance.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">In summary, a self‑attested RC photocopy, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, and an IBA‑approved consignment bilty form the backbone of compliant car transportation in Azamgarh.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Coupled with a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance, these documents safeguard your vehicle and your investment from the moment it leaves the garage to the moment it arrives at its destination.</span></li></ul></div>
